div(class='lg:pr-4')
  div(class='lg:max-w-lg')
    //- The text sits on the glass card at every breakpoint, so the palette
    //- is the light variant of the main section's description
    p.font-mono.text-sm.leading-7.text-teal-400
      span.text-white ~$&nbsp;
      | git log --author=vitor
    h1.mt-2.font-mono.text-3xl.font-bold.tracking-tight.text-white(class='sm:text-4xl') Some of my contributions to the community
    #open-source-title.p.mt-6.font-mono.text-lg.leading-8.text-gray-300
      | I love open source — it's where I learned to code, where I go to tinker, and where I give back. Building in the open, reading other people's code, and shipping patches that anyone can use is what makes software fun for me. Take a look at my GitHub to find the projects I've built and contributed to.
    .mt-8
      a.group.inline-flex.items-center.gap-3.rounded-lg.border.border-gray-700.bg-gray-900.px-6.py-4.font-mono.text-base.text-green-400.shadow-md.transform.transition-all.duration-200(
        href='https://github.com/vitorecomp',
        target='_blank',
        class='hover:bg-gray-800 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5'
      )
        span.text-gray-500 $
